        rdfs:comment """**DEPRECATED in SPDX 3.1.**
Use [/Core/version](../../Core/Properties/version.md) instead.

Identify the version of a package."""@en ;
        rdfs:range xsd:string .

    ns4:primaryPurpose a owl:ObjectProperty ;
